      "statement": "PatchToolCallsMiddleware runs in before_agent and repairs dangling tool calls: for every valid or invalid AIMessage tool call with an id lacking a matching ToolMessage, it appends an error ToolMessage that records either an incomplete call or malformed/truncated arguments, then rewrites the history.",
